@startuml AD5_Admin_Threshold_Configuration
title AD5 — Admin Threshold Configuration (Web → All Clients)

start
:Admin opens System Configuration;
:Edit ph / temp / tds / waterlevel\nmin-max values;
:Save → flat-contract write to\nTANK_01/config/thresholds;

if (Writer is admins/{uid} = true?\n(security rules check)) then (no)
  :Write rejected by security rules;
else (yes)
  fork
    :Mobile: STABLE / CAUTION tags\nre-evaluate instantly (stream);
  fork again
    :ESP32: fetches new thresholds\n(within 60 s) for alert evaluation;
  fork again
    :Web: KPI safe-range labels update;
  end fork
endif

:System-wide standard updated;
stop
@enduml
